archived/
# packages/* rather than packages/: the Next app imports @lianki/core, and the
# tsconfig alias points at packages/core/src. Excluding the whole directory made
# that alias resolve to nothing and the Vercel build fail — it never bit before
# because no file outside packages/ imported it. Only core is needed: ext is the
# MV3 extension and pardon is a submodule, neither reachable from a Next build.
packages/*
!packages/core
.husky/
*.md
!blog/**/*.md
